SUMMARY:GTApreneurs' August 25\, 2026 Annual Summer Business Networking Pa
 rty
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  a fun late afternoon/evening of business networking on a patio (or inside
  the bar area depending on the weather)! You will have the opportunity to 
 mix n mingle with other friendly entrepreneurs who may become your clients
  or referral partners\, exchange business cards and promote your business.
 \n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-vaughan\n
 \n**DATE:** August 25\, 2026\n**TIME:** 4:00 pm - 6:00 pm\n\n**VENUE:** Ea
 stside Mario’s on the patio (or bar area depending on the weather)\n**AD
 DRESS:** 2171 Steeles Ave W\, North York\, ON (Dufferin/Steeles Ave plaza)
 \n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite.\n\n**EVENT FORMAT:** Sit or stand to chat wi
 th the other guests and exchange business cards. Order yourself a beverage
  and/or some food. Build genuine connections by getting to know the others
 . Asking questions about them is a great strategy.\n\n\\*Please buy food a
 nd/or a beverage to support the venue.\n\n**TICKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Refe
 rral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n**Non-members:
 ** $15\n\n**Not a GTApreneurs Member?** Click here to view our memberships
  and register >> https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships\n
 \n\\*Includes Guest Contact Sheet emailed to you the day after the event.\
 nNote: You must attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\n**
 QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?** Call 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapreneurs.c
 om\n\n**HOST:**\n**Tammy Defoe**\, President and Founder\nGTApreneurs Inc.
 \n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text Tammy at (416) 522-7770 o
 r info@gtapreneurs.com
