SUMMARY:GTApreneurs September 9-2026 Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  a vibrant Business Networking Event in Toronto where you may meet your ne
 xt client or referral partner. Discover opportunities and connect! Registe
 r now.\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-tor
 onto\n\n**VENUE:** The Village Hive Eglinton\n**ADDRESS:** 120 Eglinton Av
 e E\, 3rd floor event space\, Toronto\, ON\n**TRANSIT:** Get off at Eglint
 on subway station\, walk East down Eglinton a few minutes and you will fin
 d it on the north side of the street in a tall office building\n**PARKING:
 ** Parking garage in Loblaws building (entrance on Lilian Street)\n\n**ITI
 NERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:05pm:** GTApre
 neurs’ presentation\n* **7:05-7:15pm:** Venue Host presentation: Serene 
 Chin\n* **7:15-8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and beverages pr
 ovided.\n\n**TICKETS:**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Meg
 a Networking Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $20\n***\\*Includes a Guest
  Contact Sheet*** emailed to you the day after the event. Note: You need t
 o attend the event to receive the sheet.\n\n**HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** 
 President of GTApreneurs\nLearn more about Tammy’s Coaching services at 
 www.gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVE
 NT?** Call 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Serene C
 hin**\, Community Manager at The Village Hive Eglinton.\n\nSerene is the f
 riendly and dedicated Community Manager at The Village Hive’s Eglinton l
 ocation in midtown Toronto. Serene brings a wealth of experience as an ent
 repreneur and mortgage broker\, along with a passion for community. She fo
 unded one of the GTA’s first dog cake bakeries\, blending her love for d
 ogs with her entrepreneurial spirit. An active community leader with the L
 eitchcroft Community Association\, Serene is always focused on building co
 nnections and supporting local businesses. Fluent in four languages and a 
 volunteer with the Markham Dog Alliance\, she brings warmth\, enthusiasm\,
  and a true connector’s spirit to The Hive.\n\n**CONTACT SERENE:**\n\\(6
 47\\) 500\\-0980 \\| [www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton](www.thevillagehive.c
 a/eglinton) \\| info@eglintonhive\\.ca\n\nView all of GTApreneurs events a
 nd services at www.gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
