SUMMARY:GTApreneurs September 29\, 2026 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us at 
 an exciting Business Networking Event in Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto
 ) on Tuesday September 29 where you can meet potential clients and referra
 l partners\, learn something new\, enjoy a meal and promote your business!
 \n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-vaughan\n
 \n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n* **FOOD SERVED:** 5:00-6:00pm\n* **VENUE
 :** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditorium\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250 Keele St\, 
 Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. and 407)\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsit
 e. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the building off of Snidercroft Rd\n\n**\\*\\
 *DIRECTIONS TO FIND THE ROOM:** Walk through entrance M\, go straight ahea
 d until you get to the main aisle. Straight ahead will be a staircase. If 
 you prefer to take the elevator\, make a right at the main aisle\, go down
  a few stores and you will see it on the left.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n
 * **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, food buffet\, visit exhibitor booths\
 n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:**
  Guest Speaker Presentation: Muhammad Khan\, ***"Cash Is King\, Forecastin
 g Is the Crown: Protecting Your Business From Cash Crunches"***\n* **6:30-
 7:00pm:** Exhibitor Introductions + member Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00
 pm:** Open networking\, visit exhibitor booths\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApr
 eneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* 
 **Non-members:** $25 in advance or $29 on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs M
 ember? Go here to view our memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.c
 om/business-networking-memberships\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall
  or text **Tammy** at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.\n\nThis even
 t will feature Guest Speaker **Muhammad Khan**\, CEO & Founder\, CFOs in A
 ction. Muhammad is the principal of CFOs In Action\, a premier Fractional 
 CFO firm in Canada. Specializing in cash flow forecasting and strategic gr
 owth\, Muhammad empowers manufacturing\, construction and service business
 es to master their finances\, optimize cash flow and scale confidently in 
 complex business environments. Muhammad equips leaders with the financial 
 foresight needed to protect and grow their bottom line.\n\nContact **Muham
 mad** at (647) 407-9097 and visit www.cfosinaction.com to learn more about
  his services.\n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, www.so
 niakurmey.arbonne.com\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https:/
 /bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n* **Abhishek Basak**\, Clerk Tech\, ww
 w.clerk-tech.com\n* **Brian Pho**\, Oasis LLP\, www.oasisllp.ca\n* **Anne 
 Bloom\,** Flourless and Flavourful\, www.instagram.com/flourlessandflavour
 ful\n\n**\\*Want to stand out?** Visit www.gtapreneurs.com/exhibitor to bo
 ok your exhibitor table\n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET th
 e day after the event by 5pm. If you don’t receive it in your inbox\, pl
 ease check your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: You must attend the event to recei
 ve the guest contact sheet.\n\n**Want 1-1 help with your business?** Learn
  about Tammy Defoe's business coaching services here: https://gtapreneurs.
 com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\n\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**DISCL
 AIMERS**\n\n* **Event Photo and Video Disclaimer:** By registering for and
 /or attending GTApreneurs (“Us” and “Our” and “We”) Events\, y
 ou give Us consent to use your image and/or video for Our publications\, a
 dvertising and/or other media activities (including the Internet).\n* **In
 formation Sharing:** By registering for or attending a GTApreneurs network
 ing event\, you are agreeing to share your name\, professional title\, org
 anization name\, city\, website (if given) and LinkedIn URL (if given) wit
 h the other event attendees who attend that event. If you indicate in your
  registration form that you give Us permission to share your phone number 
 and/or your email address with the other event attendees\, we will share t
 he information you give Us permission to share. If you indicate in the reg
 istration form that you don’t give Us permission to share your phone num
 ber and/or your email address with the other attendees\, We will not share
  it with the other attendees. GTApreneurs will never share your home addre
 ss with anyone.\n* **Event Guest Contact Sheet:** If you don’t attend an
  event\, you will not be given the guest contact sheet and your name or ot
 her information will not appear on the sheet.
