SUMMARY:GTApreneurs BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference – VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nYou are inv
 ited to an exciting mega networking bash! Join us on **Tuesday\, October 2
 0\, 2026** for **GTApreneurs’** **BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference
 !** We expect 300+ small business owners and entrepreneurs all looking to 
 meet you and many others to do business together!\n\n**REGISTER HERE** \\>
 \\> [https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx2026](https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx2026/)\
 n\n**VENUE:** Hazelton Manor\n**ADDRESS:** 99 Peelar Rd\, Vaughan\, ON\n**
 PARKING:** Free\, onsite\n\n**VIP Ticket Itinerary:**\n\n* **9:00-10:30am:
 ** Check-in\, Registration + **Continental Breakfast** and Open Networking
  + **visit Lobby & Conference Room Exhibitors**\n* **10:30-10:45am:** GTAp
 reneurs welcoming presentation\n* **10:45-11:00am:** Platinum and Gold Spo
 nsor Introductions\n* **11:00-11:20am:** **Nile Saïd** presentation\n* **
 11:20-11:40am:** **Angie Nezarati** presentation\, ***“Your income works
 \, your capital doesn’t – yet”***\n* **11:40-12:00pm: Muhammad Murta
 za Khan** presentation\, ***“Stop Guessing\, Start Growing: The Strategi
 c Power of Cash Flow Forecasting.”***\n* **12:15- 2:00pm: VIP Lunch**\n*
  **1:00-4:30pm:** BizX 2026 Business Expo (Main expo room)\n* **2:30-2:50p
 m:** Featured Speaker 4 presentation\n* **2:50-3:10pm:** **Helen Ching** p
 resentation\, ***“Early bird gets the worm. Early planning accumulates s
 ignificant business wealth.”***\n* **4:30-5:00pm:** *Awards Ceremony:* *
 **Draw and awards*** given for **door prizes\, BizX 2026 Expo Contest and 
 Exhibitor Draw**\n\n\\*Refreshments available all day – Coffee\, tea\, j
 uice\, pop\, water\n\\*Snacks available until 4:15pm\n\n**VIP TICKETS:**\n
 \n* $59 regular or $49 until August 31\, 2026\n* Free for Mega\, Exhibitor
  and Referral Group members\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today >> [https:/
 /gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships](https://gtapreneurs.com/
 business-networking-memberships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table at BizX 2026
 \,** click here >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo
 -exhibitor](https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibit
 or)\n\n**Sponsor BizX 2026**\, send us a message >> info@gtapreneurs.com\n
 \n**DOOR PRIZE RAFFLE:** Bring your business card and drop it in the box f
 or a chance to win a great prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO CONTEST:** 
 Each time you visit an exhibitor\, and exchange business cards (or exchang
 e information electronically)\, they will put a sticker on your event map.
  Fill your map with a sticker from every exhibitor to win a prize. At the 
 end of the day (4:30-5:00pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest winners as we
 ll as guest door prize winners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n**SPONSORED 
 BY:**\n\n* **Sonia Kurmey\,** Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n* **B
 albir Pabila\,** PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassocia
 te.com\n\n**DISCLAIMERS**\n***Event Photo and Video Disclaimer:*** By regi
 stering for and/or attending GTApreneurs (“Us” and “Our” and “We
 ”) Events\, you give Us consent to use your image and/or video for Our p
 ublications\, advertising and/or other media activities (including the Int
 ernet).\n\n***Information Sharing:*** By registering for or attending a GT
 Apreneurs networking event\, you are agreeing to share your name\, profess
 ional title\, organization name\, city\, website (if given) and LinkedIn U
 RL (if given) with the other event attendees who attend that event. If you
  indicate in your registration form that you give Us permission to share y
 our phone number and/or your email address with the other event attendees\
 , we will share the information you give Us permission to share. If you in
 dicate in the registration form that you don’t give Us permission to sha
 re your phone number and/or your email address with the other attendees\, 
 We will not share it with the other attendees. GTApreneurs will never shar
 e your home address with anyone.\n\n***Event Guest Contact Sheet:*** Your 
 ticket does not include the Guest or Exhibitor Contact Sheets.
